<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-02T00:56:13.442Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila, the former president, now leads a rebel coalition that includes the M23 movement and is attacking Congolese government forces in eastern DRC. Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama have been sanctioned by the United States for supplying the rebels, while the FRN reported that rebel forces captured several positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting. Ebola workers have struck in the Congo as the outbreak exceeds 5,000 deaths, prompting WHO warnings of a continent-wide spread. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/europe-today-rare-oleshky-truce-holds-in-ukraine-albania-imposes-heavy-fines-on-protesters&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9lWUlWZ29nYmstUnhiaXhNeHFGYmRGbXJZV1JKc3BBMVdvTGlWcFdxRUNpQkR2RTJFSUtmdDdWNzF1RTJrM1VGRVBZOWZJM3c5UWlmMWRVdnBOVjc4d1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNaEh5RFNCVmFzNTBCMldGdnhzRXRaeXA2eW9XcXBZU3ZZU041eGwzM0RpeTA0Z05RWmVxQWVSVm5sVElJYmZJbzB5aEYwUk9EV3djOExVRzJMeGJUQXlQUUp4OWhIdXNNWG1ocURuMkFKQVhlTXZTWURqWnBNZkdxWkxPeDN0bjFqb2JjVHdPSk91LTVQUW50dkJRQXZHcGRjQ2MwLU9SRFczUGlzNnlJQUN4eDdMaHJabzZRbGg4VjVudVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;GhanaWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9lQVlaYko2eWdBREJta3FvcHBtaks0UWQtM0VUMnRwZF8xRURtalUxWktXTEFiQzdLdkYweGdvNnN2TXl6NXA0blBpbHNrYWJpUUpSazVLeUY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Israel Defense&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;SMH.com.au&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPcjUybHpxMUdtSGRWaWJkTlFPMFJzM3pJR29JS1AwU1VBUnE3bjNWZjlJajdSMVR4VWJoVVpDU3ZMOExWX2JMY09UX2xPb1dPbzM2R0FVZV9YWk5iMlFGM1p2UmRlR01ZYjZpMnlhSnpoby1